        <mxCell id="detail-97" value="WEB: Internet → IGW → Public LB [Regional WAF] → Network Firewall → DRG → Private LB → Traefik → AIMS.&lt;br&gt;RETURN BACKEND: Private LB → DRG → Hub VCN ingress route table → Firewall → Public LB.&lt;br&gt;EGRESS: Pod / Worker → DRG → Firewall → NAT → Internet; NAT return route → Firewall → DRG → Spoke.&lt;br&gt;Admin đi Bastion; Oracle services đi Spoke SGW. Đường nét đứt xám mô tả ownership, không phải packet flow." vertex="1" parent="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#80999F;fillColor=#F4F2EF;strokeColor=none;fontSize=15;dashed=0;fontColor=#312d2a;">
